I pull my suitcase into the hallway.
I close the door.
Finally, I am in my flat.
The hallway is small, but very nice.
The furniture is already standing here.
I look around.
A mirror hangs next to the door.
A shoe rack stands under the coat hooks.
Under the mirror stands a small table.
A pen lies on the table.
My jacket hangs on a hook now.
My backpack lies on the floor.
It lies next to the suitcase.
My shoes stand in the shoe rack.
Everything has a place.
The hallway is really cozy.
I am very happy.
